            "value" : "Siempre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Companion uses this iPhone's GPS to send your paired watch's position to configured TAK servers while this phone is locked. Reporting starts automatically when a paired watch selects Companion as its relay and an enabled server with a client certificate is available. Background reporting requires Location Services, Precise Location, and Always permission; While Using access supports reporting only while Companion is open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Companion uses this iPhone's GPS to send your paired watch's position to configured TAK servers while this phone is locked. Reporting starts automatically when a paired watch selects Companion as its relay and an enabled server with a client certificate is available. Background reporting requires Location Services, Precise Location, and Always permission; While Using access supports reporting only while Companion is open."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Companion usa el GPS de este iPhone para enviar la posición de tu reloj enlazado a los servidores TAK configurados mientras el teléfono está bloqueado. Los informes se inician automáticamente cuando un reloj enlazado selecciona Companion como retransmisor y hay disponible un servidor habilitado con un certificado de cliente. Los informes en segundo plano requieren los servicios de ubicación, la ubicación precisa y el permiso Siempre; el permiso Mientras se usa solo permite informar cuando Companion está abierto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
